  "details": "When I'm trying to use IriunVR since the lasts 3 updates of VRchat, everytime I can see with the phone as VR headset that my head it's not moving on the game and the body tracking is getting bad, being unable to move myself at the game normally.\n\nI've asked some people about this \"bug\" since there's some people are using IriunVR as headset, but none of them have a solution to it. It only happens when starting VRchat (you can use this app in any other VRgame).\n\nPlease, I would like to receive any good feedback as soon as possible to help users to solve this bug.",
